<title>FRANCE: France targets firms if extra revenue needed.</title>
<headline>France targets firms if extra revenue needed.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Francois Hollande, the head of France's Socialist party, said on Wednesday that if extra budgetary measures were needed the burden would not fall on households but on profitable companies.</p>
</text>
